<title>UK: Williams says has 67.01 pct in Chubb.</title>
<headline>Williams says has 67.01 pct in Chubb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Williams Holdings said on Monday it had extended its offer to acquire Chubb Security Plc until April 29 after it had acquired 67.01 percent in Chubb's issued share capital as on April 18.</p>
<p>Williams and Chubb agreed on the merger last month which valued each Chubb share at 441.33 pence and the total share capital at 1.3 billion stg.</p>
<p>Williams said it had received valid acceptances in respect of 189.44 million Chubb shares.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366.</p>
</text>
